      "body": "### Project URL\n\nhttps://github.com/domcyrus/rustnet\n\n### Category\n\nRust\n\n### Project Title\n\nA modern, high-performance network monitor in your terminal, providing real-time process tracking and deep packet inspection.\n\n### Project Description\n\nA modern, cross-platform terminal network traffic monitor written in Rust. It identifies processes via eBPF (Linux) and PKTAP (macOS), supports deep packet inspection (DPI), and provides a beautiful TUI.\n\n### Highlights\n\nExtremely performant and visually clean. It accurately captures network connections of short-lived processes, making it an excellent modern alternative to traditional network monitoring tools.\n\n### Example Code\n\n```markdown\n\n```\n\n### Screenshots or Demo Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/domcyrus/rustnet/blob/main/assets/rustnet.gif",
